  "description": "Top of the Subvert line HT7 Plus is the ultimate Plus sized hard tail adventurer. A jack of all terrains, the HT7 features a 6000 series alloy 27.5\" Plus geometry frame with a tapered head tube. Its ultra comfortable ride is delivered by a combination of its Rockshox Revelation RL 27.5\" Boost fork with a whopping 130mm of travel combined with WTB Scraper 27.5: Plus i35 rims w/TCS tape and are tubeless ready, and iced with Kenda Havoc 27.5 x 2.8\" 120tpi tires. A SRAM GX Eagle 1X12 drive train keeps things light, simple, and efficient.\n6061-T6 Series alloy Hardtail frame, 27.5\" Plus geometry, tapered head tube, Boost thru-axle dropouts\nNew RockShox Revelation RL 27.5in Boost, 35mm, 130mm travel w/ lockout\nSram GX Eagle Boost X-SYNC 32T crankset\nSram GX Eagle 12-spd Trigger shifter\nSram GX Eagle 1x12-spd rear derailleur\nSram XG 1275 Eagle 10-50T cassette\nWTB Scraper 27.5\" Plus i35 rims w/ TCS tape, Tubeless ready\nKenda Havoc tires, 27.5x2.8\", 120 tpi, Aramid beads, Tubeless ready\nSram Level T hydraulic disc brakeset",
